## The partner token

<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tokenWo`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`TokenWo`" pulumi-lang-go="`tokenWo`" pulumi-lang-python="`token_wo`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tokenWo`" pulumi-lang-java="`tokenWo`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`token_wo`">`tokenWo`</span> is sent on create and whenever <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tokenWoVersion`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`TokenWoVersion`" pulumi-lang-go="`tokenWoVersion`" pulumi-lang-python="`token_wo_version`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tokenWoVersion`" pulumi-lang-java="`tokenWoVersion`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`token_wo_version`">`tokenWoVersion`</span> changes (a later send replaces the stored token). Leave both out to register the platform first and store the token later. A stored token cannot be cleared except by destroying the resource, which removes the platform and its token. <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tokenSet`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`TokenSet`" pulumi-lang-go="`tokenSet`" pulumi-lang-python="`token_set`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tokenSet`" pulumi-lang-java="`tokenSet`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`token_set`">`tokenSet`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tokenPrefix`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`TokenPrefix`" pulumi-lang-go="`tokenPrefix`" pulumi-lang-python="`token_prefix`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tokenPrefix`" pulumi-lang-java="`tokenPrefix`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`token_prefix`">`tokenPrefix`</span> (the first characters, to tell tokens apart) show that a token is held; the token itself is never available.

<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`apiBaseUrl`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ApiBaseUrl`" pulumi-lang-go="`apiBaseUrl`" pulumi-lang-python="`api_base_url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`apiBaseUrl`" pulumi-lang-java="`apiBaseUrl`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`api_base_url`">`apiBaseUrl`</span> is sent together with the token; it takes effect when the token is sent.

## Registering with the partner

<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`receiverUrl`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ReceiverUrl`" pulumi-lang-go="`receiverUrl`" pulumi-lang-python="`receiver_url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`receiverUrl`" pulumi-lang-java="`receiverUrl`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`receiver_url`">`receiverUrl`</span> (or <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`receiverUrlTemplate`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ReceiverUrlTemplate`" pulumi-lang-go="`receiverUrlTemplate`" pulumi-lang-python="`receiver_url_template`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`receiverUrlTemplate`" pulumi-lang-java="`receiverUrlTemplate`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`receiver_url_template`">`receiverUrlTemplate`</span> when the partner registers per site) is where the partner delivers events for this instance; give it to the partner. <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`registrationStatus`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`RegistrationStatus`" pulumi-lang-go="`registrationStatus`" pulumi-lang-python="`registration_status`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`registrationStatus`" pulumi-lang-java="`registrationStatus`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`registration_status`">`registrationStatus`</span> reads <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`registered`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Registered`" pulumi-lang-go="`registered`" pulumi-lang-python="`registered`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`registered`" pulumi-lang-java="`registered`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`registered`">`registered`</span> once the partner has registered it. <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`lastDeliveryAt`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`LastDeliveryAt`" pulumi-lang-go="`lastDeliveryAt`" pulumi-lang-python="`last_delivery_at`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`lastDeliveryAt`" pulumi-lang-java="`lastDeliveryAt`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`last_delivery_at`">`lastDeliveryAt`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`lastDeliveryError`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`LastDeliveryError`" pulumi-lang-go="`lastDeliveryError`" pulumi-lang-python="`last_delivery_error`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`lastDeliveryError`" pulumi-lang-java="`lastDeliveryError`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`last_delivery_error`">`lastDeliveryError`</span> show the latest delivery.

## Import

